<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Starbucks rating upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Starbucks rating upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth Thursday upgraded Starbucks Corp to buy from hold, with a 12-month price target of $44.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Diane Daggatt said positive near-term events could build momentum in the stock, including the company's lower-than-expected advertising spending in October and increased traffic during the holiday shopping season.</p>
<p>-- Starbucks also posted favorable earnings comparisons for the fiscal year, and has the potential for earnings surprises, Daggatt said.</p>
<p>-- Starbucks stock was unchanged Thursday at 33-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
